# Change Documentation

- After making any code, configuration, styling, schema, or documentation change, create or update a Markdown record in `docs/changes/`.
- Name new records `YYYY-MM-DD-short-description.md`.
- Include the requested behavior, files changed, implementation details, and verification performed.
- Include the actual code added or modified in fenced code blocks, followed by a plain-language explanation.
- When a complete function or component is too large, show the relevant changed section or a concise before/after diff instead.
- Keep the record synchronized if the implementation changes again during the same task.
- Provide a clickable link to the change record in the final response.
